Package: MatchOmics
Type: Package
Title: Propensity Score Matching Framework for Heterogeneity-Aware Omics Association Analysis
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Nam-Eun",
           family = "Kim",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "garameunn@gmail.com")
Description: Implements propensity score matching and weighted generalized
    estimating equations (GEE) for heterogeneity-aware omics association
    analysis. The package features a two-round rescue matching algorithm
    that improves sample retention compared to single-round matching while
    maintaining strict PS-caliper control. Supports proteomics, metabolomics,
    and metagenomics data. Weights are mean-normalised (Kish 1965) to ensure
    GEE operates on the correct effective sample size.
